      "provenance": {
        "kind": "handwritten",
        "rationale": "An explicit source gap is an accepted input to the fold, not an error: it advances the cursor and lets the window seal, and the registered coverage policy is what refuses it afterwards. Under COMPLETE_REQUIRED the fact is exactly 6003, an explicit missing bucket in the range. The implementation reports the coarse CoverageRefused, which cannot distinguish this from a bounded-gaps budget overrun, so the acceptance is a declared coarsening rather than an exact match.",
