        "kind": "handwritten",
        "rationale": "A result is interchangeable with another only when every field of its domain is equal, and check_domain names which field differed. Repair generation is the field an adapter is most likely to get wrong under a feed repair, so a wrong generation must never collapse into one opaque mismatch. Each step differs from the expected domain in exactly one field.",
